OL,3,CMan admits false imprisonment after
OL,4,Ctaking ambulance with patient inside
OL,6,FA man has admitted false imprisonment
OL,7,Fafter an ambulance was taken from
OL,8,Foutside a hospital with a patient
OL,9,Finside.
OL,11,FPolice were called Royal Stoke
OL,12,FUniversity Hospital at around 8.15pm
OL,13,Fto a report of a man taking the
OL,14,Femergency vehicle on March 25th.
